1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,760
What if a few lines of code

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,670
became the start of a new passion?

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:12,130
With L9ITHA.Club, students discover
Python programming

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:16,320
in a structured computer club,
with step-by-step activities

5
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,280
and the support of their teacher.

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,400
Two tracks, Junior and Pro,

7
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,570
offer a progression suited to each age.

8
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,920
We warm up, practise with guidance,

9
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,110
practise on our own, then take on a challenge.

10
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:34,210
Students write their code, run it
and watch the result.

11
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:38,210
Hints and messages in French
help them understand their mistakes.

12
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,750
They fix it, try again and move forward.

13
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:43,580
Their work is saved
for the next session.

14
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:50,940
For parents, it's a supervised activity

15
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,860
to build logical thinking,
encourage creativity

16
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:56,350
and learn to persevere when facing a problem.

17
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:04,090
For schools, the platform brings together
the club's organisation,

18
00:01:04,110 --> 00:01:06,170
the course materials and the exercises.

19
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:09,510
The teacher presents the session,
opens the activities

20
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:13,600
and sees attendance, progress
and results for every student.

21
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:18,740
From first attempts to coding challenges,

22
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,790
every session invites students
to understand code

23
00:01:21,810 --> 00:01:23,670
and to bring their ideas to life.

24
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:26,040
Discover L9ITHA.Club.

25
00:01:26,060 --> 00:01:29,790
To join the club or request
a demo, get in touch.
